<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Woodcommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.125    MATURITY    30.APR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.91    PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  85 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
